# Record and gates: qa/box-a-megakernel-20261029/ (README, raw/box-a-return/NOTES.md). Not byte-exact vs the
# final; hangwatch.py (--service --on-hang kill) and the TP probe (env-box-a-mk.txt) watch it in serving.
